Third-party code not covered by this license

This project is built on the starter project of Anthropic Academy's
"Introduction to Model Context Protocol" course
(https://academy.claude.com/courses/introduction-to-model-context-protocol).
That starter code is the work of Anthropic and is not licensed under the MIT
License above; all rights to it remain with Anthropic. It includes:

- core/ (chat.py, claude.py, cli.py, cli_chat.py, tools.py)
- main.py
- the base of mcp_server.py (server setup and the sample documents) and of
  mcp_client.py (the MCPClient connection and session handling)
- the original setup and usage instructions in README.md

The MIT License above covers the rest: the lesson implementations in
mcp_server.py and mcp_client.py, the tests, the Docker setup, the fix in
core/cli.py, and the documentation added on top of the course's README.
